  "details": "TeleportTo is a very common and basic functionality for many maps, but depending on the way they are used (commonly longer distance non-lerped teleports) they can be very noticeable or jarring due to avatar physbones.\n\nHair or tails can suddenly freak out, especially if they have high stretch and/or momentum.\n\nThis doesn't just go for teleports from doors, teleport pads, and game teleports, respawning does this as well. It's just a slight peeve that has broken the illusion for me in 1 too many maps with otherwise seamless teleports",
